Package: powershift
Title: Compare How Quickly Countries Are Changing Their Electricity Mix
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      "Smit", "Tambat",
      email = "tambat.smit@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides Our World in Data estimates of how much of each
    country's electricity came from coal, gas, oil, nuclear, hydro, wind,
    solar, bioenergy and other renewables from 1985 to 2025, a function that
    measures how much each source's share changed between two years, and a
    'shiny' app that helps an energy policy analyst compare how quickly
    countries are changing their electricity mix.
